nautilus-my-computer (0.11.7-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Fix a drive being listed twice in the Computer view when it is mounted
    through autofs (e.g. some fstab/NAS network share setups): the autofs
    trigger mount and the real filesystem mounted on top of it were both
    shown as separate cards. The scanner now only accepts known
    real-storage, network, or optical filesystem types, imports GIO's
    shadowed-mount signal, and collapses any leftover same-mountpoint
    duplicates to the visible mount (issue #57).

